%N A126498 Number of base 30 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by three or less.
%C A126498 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+7^(n-1) for base>=3n-2; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+7^(n-1)-2 when base=3n-3
%H A126498 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126498 <a href="/index/Rec#order_15">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (17,-89,75,535,-791,-1177,1725,1121,-1493,-447,540,55,-68,-1,2).
%o A126498 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>3)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>3))
%Y A126498 Cf. Base 30 differing by two or less A126417, one or less A126384.
